---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Luxury Flats Under 2 Crore in Pune: 3 BHK Balcony Residences & Price Analysis",
  "description": "Comprehensive guide for buying 3 BHK luxury flats under ₹2 Crore in Pune. Compare Baner, Balewadi, Mahalunge and why Mahindra Rivenza 3 BHK from ₹1.45 Cr sets the luxury benchmark.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Pune Real Estate Research Desk"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Mahindra Rivenza"
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-10-09",
  "dateModified": "2026-10-10"
};
---

<Layout
  title="Luxury Flats Under 2 Crore in Pune | 3 BHK Price Analysis"
  description="Guide to buying luxury 3 BHK flats under ₹2 Crore in Pune. Compare locations, carpet sizes (995 to 1,206 sq.ft), and Mahindra Rivenza 3 BHK residences from ₹1.45 Cr*."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/luxury-flats-under-2-crore-in-pune/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Luxury Buyer Intelligence</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>October 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Luxury Flats Under ₹2 Crore in Pune: 3 BHK Residences &amp; Value Analysis
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          For senior IT managers, doctors, and business leaders, the ₹1.3 Cr to ₹2.0 Cr budget bracket unlocks spacious 3 BHK residences with panoramic balconies, private sundecks, and resort clubhouse amenities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Sections -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. The 3 BHK Luxury Market Landscape in West Pune</h2>
        <p>
          In central Baner, premium 3 BHKs have crossed ₹2.3 to ₹2.8 Crores due to high base land costs. However, in <strong>Baner Annex (Mahalunge)</strong>, institutional master developments deliver equivalent luxury finishes, larger green acreage, and resort pools for ₹1.45 Cr to ₹1.85 Cr.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Mahindra Rivenza 3 BHK: Space &amp; Amenity Specifications</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Generous RERA Carpet (995 – 1,206 Sq.Ft):</strong> Palatial living-dining areas, double balconies overlooking the Mula River and Baner Hills.</li>
          <li><strong>40+ Resort Amenities:</strong> Signature swimming pool with sunken bar, championship tennis and basketball courts, Technogym fitness center.</li>
          <li><strong>80% Biophilic Open Spaces:</strong> 9+ acres of landscaped greenery ensuring low-density, quiet living.</li>
          <li><strong>Pre-Approved Bank Financing:</strong> Available from SBI, HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank at competitive 8.35%* interest rates.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <!-- Lead Advisory Card -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-800 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">Explore 3 BHK Luxury Residences at Rivenza</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-300">Schedule a private walkthrough of our sample luxury residences in Baner Annex.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <a href="tel:+917744009295" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors">
            Call: +91 7744009295
          </a>
          <a href="/residences/3-bhk/" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white text-xs font-semibold transition-colors">
            View 3 BHK Floor Plans
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
